Computing [3/3] temporal Padé approximant for Allen-Cahn equation...
 f0=cos(pi*x)
 f1=-pi**2*kappa*cos(pi*x)
 f2=pi**4*kappa**2*cos(pi*x)
 f3=-pi**6*kappa**3*cos(pi*x)
 f4=pi**8*kappa**4*cos(pi*x)
 f5=-pi**10*kappa**5*cos(pi*x)
 f6=pi**12*kappa**6*cos(pi*x)
 b0=1 (normalised)
 b1=pi**2*kappa/2
 b2=pi**4*kappa**2/10
 b3=pi**6*kappa**3/120
 a0=cos(pi*x)
 a1=-pi**2*kappa*cos(pi*x)/2
 a2=pi**4*kappa**2*cos(pi*x)/10
 a3=-pi**6*kappa**3*cos(pi*x)/120
 P[3/3](x,t) = (-pi**6*kappa**3*t**3*cos(pi*x)/120 + pi**4*kappa**2*t**2*cos(pi*x)/10 - pi**2*kappa*t*cos(pi*x)/2 + cos(pi*x))/(pi**6*kappa**3*t**3/120 + pi**4*kappa**2*t**2/10 + pi**2*kappa*t/2 + 1)


